Q08 리뷰 기반 효자상품 [before]

PERFORMANCE SQL
EXPLAIN (ANALYZE, BUFFERS)
SELECT
            p.product_id,
            p.product_name,
            avg(r.rating) AS avg_rating,
            count(*) AS review_count
        FROM ecom.products p
        JOIN ecom.reviews r
          ON r.product_id = p.product_id
        GROUP BY
            p.product_id,
            p.product_name
        HAVING avg(r.rating) >= 4.5
           AND count(*) >= 50
        ORDER BY
            avg_rating DESC,
            review_count DESC,
            p.product_id

